# The web build output is embedded into the binary by web/embed.go, so it has to
# exist before `go build` — but it is a build artifact (`make web`, or `make
# build` which runs it first), never a source file. Committing it meant every UI
# change arrived in the repo as an unreadable diff of minified JavaScript.
/web/dist/

